        "TileImage": "$($repository 35b393a7-7b60-48d8-9507-7b1993daa7a9).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47, and welcome to Miami, Florida. Your task today is to murder two undercover partners in crime trying to sabotage the race. Albert Noah is disguised as a mascot and located near the parking garage. Fishy Joe is pranced up on a post near a guard station. Eliminate them both and save the riders from injury or death. Good luck 47.",
